Wɔakora so tẽẽ akɔ:
{0}

Adwumayɛ dwumadie ho adanseɛ a wɔakora so ama:

{0}

Siesie Synix bio na yɛ nsɛm ahorow a wɔde asɛmu kyerɛkyerɛ ansa na woayi no.

GitHub sign-in code:

{0}

Wɔtwee hyehyɛɛ no kɔɔ kratafa no so. Select OK to open GitHub, pete code no, na pene so Synix.

Fa saa asɛm yi to gua GitHub asɛm no?

{0}

Di kan hwɛ nsɛso afã no mu na hwɛ sɛ ɛnka nsɛm a ɛyɛ kokoam.

Eyi bɛpam afiri no afebɔɔ wɔ: {0}
Wɔbɛpopa saa adesoa yi ho import abakɔsɛm ne adesoa nnwinnade a wɔakora so wɔ Synix mu nso.
Wɔkora nkuraasefoɔ backup archives nyinaa so gye sɛ woahyɛ ɔfã a ɛwɔ ase ha yi so.

Kɔ so yi backup a wɔakora so yi fi hɔ daa?

{0}
{1:f}

Wɔrenyɛ nsakrae wɔ dwumadibea no nsɛm ho.

Wɔmaa Synix kɔyɛɛ amanne wɔ:

{0}

Wobɛtumi asan agye Synix nsaano nkyerɛwee ne Discord webhooks wɔ kɔmputa foforo no so afa asetsena yi so. Fa no to adansedi no so; wontumi nnyae.

Synix de kɔɔ:

{0}

Wɔmmɔ saa adansedi yi ho dawuru, enti fa sie baabi a ɛyɛ kokoam. Synix password ne Discord webhooks a wɔde di dwuma no bɛhia sɛ wɔsan de kɔ kɔmputa foforo so.

